# Viewport floor

Support **320px** as the minimum width. Compact chrome, overlay legend, menus, and place cards must stay fully visible there — no overflow under zoom, no clipped labels, no horizontal page scroll.

Check 320px when changing layout or copy. Do not treat 360px or 720px as the smallest phone.
